 "title": "Invertible ideal",
 "statement": "A quasi-coherent ideal $\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal O_X$ is\n*invertible* if it is locally free of rank one as an\n$\\mathcal O_X$-module. The inclusion $\\mathcal I\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal O_X$\nis part of the ideal data; regularity of a local generator is not included\nin this definition.",
